#: package/emortal/luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:51
msgid ""
"Limits all traffic leaving a physical PPE port. A WAN port limit controls "
"upload; a LAN port limit also affects local traffic to that port. This does "
"not provide a shared download limit across LAN and Wi-Fi or per-host fair "
"queueing."
msgstr ""
"限制经 PPE 物理端口发出的全部流量。WAN 端口限速控制上传；LAN 端口限速也会影响"
"发往该端口的局域网流量。此功能不提供 LAN 与 Wi-Fi 共享下载总限速或按主机公平"
"排队。"

