msgid "Telephony, voice"
msgstr "电话、语音"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:250
msgid "The DSCP map and the small packet priority stay in effect either way."
msgstr "无论是否启用此项，DSCP 映射和小包优先级都会保持生效。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:322
msgid ""
"The DSCP to mark with, as a class name or a number from 0 to 63. It picks "
"the switch queue through the DSCP map below and the Wi-Fi access category "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"要设置的 DSCP，可填写类别名称或 0 到 63 之间的数值。它通过下方的 DSCP 映射选"
"择交换机队列，并直接决定 Wi-Fi 访问类别。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:24
msgid "The port rejected the requested queue settings."
msgstr "端口拒绝了请求的队列参数。"

